@startuml seq-a-failover
title Вариант 1: failover push -> SMS, отказ SMS-агрегатора A
autonumber
participant "Push\nSender" as PSND
participant "FCM / APNs" as FCM
database "Delivery\nState DB" as DB
participant "Escalation\nScheduler" as ES
participant "Outbox\nRelay" as OR
queue "Kafka" as K
participant "SMS\nSender" as SS
participant "SMS-агрегатор A" as A
participant "SMS-агрегатор B" as B
participant "Receipt API" as RA
participant "Receipt\nHandler" as RH

PSND -> DB: state='PUSH_SENDING' WHERE state='PUSH_PENDING'
PSND -> FCM: send(token, apns-collapse-id / tag, ttl=10s)
FCM --> PSND: message_id
PSND -> DB: state='PUSH_SENT', next_action_at=now()+10s
note over FCM: устройство офлайн,\nчерез 10 с FCM отбрасывает push по ttl
...10 секунд без квитанции...
ES -> DB: SELECT ... WHERE next_action_at <= now()\nFOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED LIMIT 500
ES -> DB: UPDATE SET state='SMS_PENDING', next_action_at=now()+30s\nWHERE id=? AND state='PUSH_SENT';\nINSERT outbox(tx.send.sms); COMMIT
OR -> K: tx.send.sms
K -> SS: tx.send.sms
SS -> DB: UPDATE SET state='SMS_SENDING'\nWHERE id=? AND state='SMS_PENDING'
note right of SS: 0 строк (уже DELIVERED) -> SMS не отправляется
SS -> A: send(phone, text, client_msg_id=nid:sms)
A --> SS: 503
SS -> A: повтор через 200 мс
A --> SS: 503
note over SS: circuit breaker агрегатора A открыт\n(5 ошибок за 10 с)
SS -> B: send(phone, text, client_msg_id=nid:sms)
B --> SS: accepted(msg_id)
SS -> DB: UPDATE SET state='SMS_SENT', provider='B', next_action_at=now()+120s\nWHERE id=? AND state='SMS_SENDING'
B -> RA: DLR delivered(msg_id)
RA -> K: receipts
K -> RH: receipts
RH -> DB: UPDATE SET state='DELIVERED', channel='sms', next_action_at=NULL\nWHERE id=? AND state NOT IN ('DELIVERED','UNCONFIRMED','FAILED')
alt DLR не пришёл за 120 с или DLR failed
  ES -> DB: state='EMAIL_PENDING' + outbox(tx.send.email)
  note right of ES: после email шаг финальный:\nstate='UNCONFIRMED' или 'FAILED', алерт дежурному
end
@enduml
